{"id":"n71356-1-7","stage":0,"title":"진하다 · 浓","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71356-1-7-1","ko":"커피가 너무 진하다.","zh":"咖啡太浓了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피가","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"진하다.","meaning":"浓，稠","explanation":"진하다：浓，稠；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"진하다","audio":"/audio/3e25867b1220e775a63f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71356","senseId":"1","lemma":"진하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"3e25867b1220e775","term":"진하다","zh":"浓，稠","audio":"/audio/3e25867b1220e775a63f.mp3","entryId":"71356","definition":"液体不稀，浓度高。","pronunciation":["진하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e23ec1e325d2f9e3f30b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71356-1-7-2","ko":"내가 커피를 너무 많이 넣었나 봐.","zh":"看来是我加的咖啡太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피를","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2",